  "question": {
    "text": "The mean and standard deviation of the marks of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn></math> students were found to be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn></math> respectively. Later, it was observed that two marks <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn></math> were wrongly read as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>45</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50</mn></math> respectively. Then the correct variance is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "269",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Let the observations be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>50</mn></math>,</p><p>Mean<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>405</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Hence, new mean</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced><mover><mi>X</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mfenced><mi>new</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>405</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn></math></p><p>Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>8</mn></munderover><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>45</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>50</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mstyle><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>50</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>8</mn></munderover><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>4525</mn></mstyle><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>2500</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>8</mn></munderover><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>21915</mn></math></p><p>Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced><mi>Variance</mi></mfenced><mi>new</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>8</mn></munderover><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>20</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>25</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mstyle><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>45</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mfenced><mi>Variance</mi></mfenced><mi>new</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>21915</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>20</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>25</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mstyle><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>45</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mfenced><mi>Variance</mi></mfenced><mi>new</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2294</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2025</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mfenced><mi>Variance</mi></mfenced><mi>new</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>269</mn></math></p><p>Hence this is the correct answer.</p></blockquote>",
